# 🎭 Isolated API Integration & Security Testing Framework
An enterprise-grade, high-velocity API automation testing framework built completely from scratch utilizing **Playwright Engine** and **TypeScript**. This architecture bypasses flaky user interfaces to target backend microservices directly—delivering robust validation in milliseconds.

## ⚡ Performance Metric
* **Total Execution Velocity:** ~414ms (Full pipeline suite execution)
* **Test Stability Index:** 100% Flakiness-Free due to deep network layer isolation.

## 🏗️ Architectural Core Capabilities
* **Dynamic Data Generation Assembly:** Leverages the `@faker-js/faker` engine to instantiate randomized, compliant user profiles and blog records on the fly, guaranteeing clean database states.
* **API Transaction Chaining:** Automatically extracts stateful data payloads (JWT Security Tokens) from registration actions and pipelines them seamlessly into authenticated data-creation endpoints.
* **Negative Security Boundary Shields:** Intentionally enforces malicious structural payloads and broken validation keys to verify that the target environment correctly blocks unauthorized breach attempts with rigid HTTP `401 Unauthorized` responses.
* **Execution Environment Isolation:** Designed to run inside localized sandbox contexts to ensure smooth CI/CD test runs even during third-party cloud provider DNS outages.

